# Both Dockerfiles build entirely from an existing image or a root-level .deb.
# Keep the build context small; the 100+ MB source tree is not copied into an
# image and only slowed every build down.
**
!Dockerfile
!blastfoam_*.deb
!tools/
!tools/blast_case_ui/
!tools/blast_case_ui/Dockerfile.server-web

# Defensive exclusions if the allow-list above is broadened later.
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
